rror\" is a Netflix show.\n\n2. **Logical Deductions**:\n   - Since Karen does not download \"Black Mirror\" (\u00acD), and **B \u2194 D**, it follows that she does not binge-watch it: **\u00acB(\"Black Mirror\")**.\n   - Using the contrapositive of **P \u2192 B** (which is **\u00acB \u2192 \u00acP**), the absence of binge-watching (\u00acB) implies **\u00acP(\"Black Mirror\")** (\"Black Mirror\" is not popular).\n\n3. **Conclusion**:\n   - The statement \"Black Mirror is popular\" is **false** because the premises lead to its negation.\n\n**Answer**: B) False",
