e specifies that if a player leaves a team, they \"no longer play for that team.\" Since leaving the team definitively ends their association with it, the statement \"Robert Lewandowski plays for Bayern Munchen\" is **false**. There is no ambiguity or uncertainty provided in the premises to suggest otherwise.",
